6470 0 obj
  << /ActualText (In my design attempt\054 I wanted to provide the user more context by giving a preview window of the document\056\nI quickly realized this was now a mini version of the full product and wondered what benefit served\056 Why in V3 are users signing documents sight unseen\077 \nIn later User Testing users talked about previewing the document with other tools since V3 is so slow\056 I asked the PM if this feature was made to avoid using the UI and it\220s slow PDF viewer\056 It was before his time but felt this was a good guess\056 This had me turn my focus back to the main UI and how I could make it the best experience that it made this redundant\056\nRevised design is near the end\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 6471 0 R
     /Pg 3252 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
